{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:d135def7ff820ca2","name":"Too-Onebee","source":{"id":"source:reference-d135def7ff820ca2","title":"Too-Onebee","revision":21774,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T02:27:36Z","sha256":"e6373b2c20dfe0983f02c6a453705799fbefb445855ef854f6f07e954438b6fa","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21774","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Too-Onebee&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-d135def7ff820ca2","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Star Wars Miniatures Previews"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Star_Wars_Miniatures_Previews"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Rebel Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Rebel_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:52c543ff6d31425c"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The New Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_New_Republic","referenceId":"reference:e6046dbb57e5abb0"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Too-Onebee is an older model of Medical Droid who once served ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"}," on the planet ",{"tag":"a","children":["Firro"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Firro?action=edit&redlink=1"}," shortly after that world was subject to Imperial occupation. Tasked with tending to civilians injured or maimed by Imperial atrocities, Too-Onebee provided care to a seemingly unending stream of the wounded or dying before being assigned to the newly proclaimed governor, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lord Cuvir"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lord_Cuvir?action=edit&redlink=1"},". Forced to serve those who caused the very injuries that he was programmed to heal, Too-Onebee began to realize that he longed to serve those on the \"right\" side of the war.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Later, when ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lord Cuvir"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lord_Cuvir?action=edit&redlink=1"}," was assassinated by the Rebel agent \"Tiree\" (",{"tag":"a","children":["Tay Vanis"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tay_Vanis?action=edit&redlink=1"},"), Too-Onebee dutifully attempted to render aid to the mortally wounded governor even as he saw an opportunity to escape Imperial servitude. Too-Onebee joined Tiree and fled the planet, accompanying him on a few missions for ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Rebel Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Rebel_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:52c543ff6d31425c"}," before being assigned to the medical unit in Echo Base on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hoth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hoth?action=edit&redlink=1"},". He would later serve on the medical frigate ",{"tag":"i","children":["Redemption"]},", and he continued to serve ",{"tag":"a","children":["The New Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_New_Republic","referenceId":"reference:e6046dbb57e5abb0"}," after the fall of the Empire.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Too-Onebee Statistics (CL 4)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["1st-Degree Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/1st-Degree_Droid"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonheroic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonheroic","referenceId":"reference:1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3"}," 3/",{"tag":"a","children":["Noble"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Noble","referenceId":"reference:190d375ec3483f8f"}," 3\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"},":"]}," 3\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://s